  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Finely chop the brown onion. Finely chop the\n• garlic. Slice the corn kernels from the cob. Finely\n• chop the tomato. Roughly chop the coriander.\n• Shred the cos lettuce (see ingredients). Drain and\n• rinse the black beans.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/5fcd6c700da94b65b75e7dd6/step-a8bf72aa.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Heat a large frying pan over a medium-high heat.\n• Cook the corn kernels, tossing occasionally, until\n• golden and lightly charred, 4-5 minutes. Transfer\n• to a medium bowl.\n• TIP: Cover the pan with a lid or foil if the corn\n• kernels start \"popping\" out!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/5fcd6c700da94b65b75e7dd6/step-72162f89.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• SPICY! This is a mild spice blend, but feel free to\n• add less or more, depending on your taste. Return\n• the frying pan to a medium-high heat with a drizzle\n• of olive oil. Cook the onion until softened, 2-3\n• minutes. Add the garlic and cook until fragrant,\n• 1 minute. Add the black beans and cook until\n• softened, 2-3 minutes. Add another drizzle of olive\n• oil and the Tex-Mex spice blend (see ingredients)\n• and cook until fragrant, 1 minute.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/5fcd6c700da94b65b75e7dd6/step-b2293a35.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Add the tomato paste, 1/2 the mild chipotle\n• sauce and the water to the frying pan and stir to\n• coat. Reduce the heat to medium and simmer until\n• the sauce has thickened slightly, 4-5 minutes.\n• Season to taste.\n• TIP: Add a dash more water to loosen if needed!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/5fcd6c700da94b65b75e7dd6/step-26fd2696.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• In a small bowl, combine the sour cream and the\n• remaining mild chipotle sauce. Heat the mini\n• flour tortillas in a sandwich press, or on a plate in\n• the microwave for 10 second bursts, until warmed\n• through. Add the tomato, coriander, white wine\n• vinegar and a drizzle of olive oil to the corn.\n• Season to taste and toss to coat.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/5fcd6c700da94b65b75e7dd6/step-d0b78996.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Take everything to the table to serve. Spread a\n• layer of chipotle sour cream over each tortilla. Top\n• with chopped cos lettuce, the chipotle black beans,\n• shredded Cheddar cheese and charred corn salsa.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/5fcd6c700da94b65b75e7dd6/step-9c9ffee2.jpg"
    }
  ]
